@@ -9,6 +9,12 @@ pnpm install && pnpm run start
 
 The application will now be running on `http://localhost:11224`.
 
+The application sends a `Permissions-Policy` header allowing its own origin to
+request local network and loopback access, including the legacy
+`local-network-access` directive for older browsers. Deployed pages must use HTTPS;
+users must still grant the browser's network permission, and local services must
+allow the application's origin through CORS when serving cross-origin responses.
